{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["One: Kagayaku Kisetsu e","Orihara Kouhei returns to his town after a long disappearance to fulfill the promises he made to several girls in his childhood. He suffered from memory loss and carries a tragic past. A strange ambience surrounds the OVA...It's almost like a dream, like memories from the past trying to come together in one piece but without being able to...\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ONE ～輝く季節へ～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":1113,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-675","ids":{"shikimori":675,"mal":675,"anilist":675,"kodik":"serial-28575"},"kodikIds":["serial-28575"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28575":"2020-08-11T10:30:41Z"},"title":"Один: Блистательный сезон","originalTitle":"One: Kagayaku Kisetsu e","alt":"One ～輝く季節へ～ One: Kagayaku Kisetsu e ONE ～輝く季節へ～","description":"Орихара Кохэй Орихара возвращается в свой город после долгого исчезновения, чтобы выполнить обещания, которые он дал нескольким девочкам в детстве. Он страдал потерей памяти и имеет трагическое прошлое. Странная атмосфера окружает этот OVA...It это почти как сон, как воспоминания из прошлого, пытающиеся собраться воедино, но безуспешно...","year":2001,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","Сверхъестественное"],"rating":5.22,"popularity":1656,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[1113],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/675/4c36180a565010cd6a5e04d71ed23eb5.jpeg","width":445,"height":630},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/c914ece3547555e3e773529c728f92023eb88eb9.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-28575","translationId":"674","url":"https: